INT. ORBITAL GREENHOUSE RING - SECTOR NINE - NIGHT CYCLE

Tomato vines. Grow-lights. A hull groan. Then the alarm.

COMMANDER IFEOMA VANCE (50s, flight suit, grease-stained) slams the manual valve while BOTANIST RUSLAN TOKAYEV (30s, wiry) drags the cart of seedlings clear and MEDIC PRIYA NAIR (30s) seals the hatch behind them as TECH JUNO BELL (20s, goggles) hammers a bypass and CADET MARCO DELACROIX (18) freezes by the airlock wheel, hands shaking. At the console, PILOT SEUN-AH KIM (40s, headset) calls out numbers.

VANCE
Pressure!

TOKAYEV
Dropping!

NAIR
Hatch seated!

BELL
^Bypass hot!

Silence. Hiss. The needle halts.

KIM
Breach contained. Sector Nine stable.

Delacroix laughs, a shaky bark. Vance wipes her face with a glove, leaving soot.

VANCE
Marco. Wheel.

DELACROIX
Yes ma'am.

He turns it. Slowly. The light goes green.

TOKAYEV
(to a seedling)
Good girl. Hang on.
